cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Eriksson Programme: Machine-Checked Lattice Yang-Mills Foundations and Open Frontier in Lean 4"
message: "If you use this software, Lean 4 formalization, verification ledgers, or accompanying manuscripts, please cite this archival release."
type: software
